{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23011","main_id":23011,"main_title":"等量再交换!","main_description":"在须弥城里，你看见了一个熟悉的身影…","chapter_title":"等量再交换!","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2301101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2301101,"sequence":16,"variant":0,"line_id":230110122,"next_line_ids":[230110123],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1517,"speaker_text_hash":1810266797,"speaker":"维克多","speaker_raw":"维克多","text_hash":176316314,"text":"嘿嘿，而且干这个活，在工作时有很多空闲时间，而且也没人一直盯着我…","raw_text":"嘿嘿，而且干这个活，在工作时有很多空闲时间，而且也没人一直盯着我…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2301101.json"}
